Line 1: An amount of money has at most two decimals, for the cents.
    say $1.234, 4.555 dollars.
        ^^^^^^
Round it first, like "$1.23".

Line 3: This amount of money is too big for me to keep exactly.
    say $100,000,000,000,000.
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Amounts can go up to 90 trillion.

